# Keep POSIX scripts LF on every checkout. CRLF here breaks the very thing this
# harness exists to do: Cygwin's sh chokes on `\r` in QEMU's configure (that was
# the whole Unicorn cross-build bug). Do not let autocrlf reintroduce it.
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf
shims/strings   text eol=lf
shims/pkg-config text eol=lf
